# 🎬 TrueReview

### Honest reviews. No spoilers. No bias.

> **TrueReview** is a social movie platform where reviews stay hidden until you've watched and rated the film yourself — ensuring every opinion you see is genuine, and every opinion you give is uninfluenced.

